## 9. Authenticated Testing

**Not available — no credentials were provided for this engagement.**

The authenticated attack surface was therefore not assessed. Authenticated testing (broken object/function-level authorization and IDOR per `secskills kb access-control`; session management, token handling, and MFA per `secskills kb auth-session`; business-logic and authenticated XSS) requires valid credentials. Re-run with `--auth-token <t>` / `--cookie <c>` / `--auth-header 'Name: value'` to include it.

